WEBVTT

9a4946ff-e985-4e2e-9e3b-10dbb0f7a722-0
00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.650
Welcome to the demonstration
video for the chemotherapy

9a4946ff-e985-4e2e-9e3b-10dbb0f7a722-1
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.760
hazardous drug CSP manipulation.

cd05bafc-c8bf-433e-9f2d-516773ad466c-0
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.675
Please review the step by step
procedure in the procedural lab

cd05bafc-c8bf-433e-9f2d-516773ad466c-1
00:00:11.675 --> 00:00:13.320
portion of the textbook.

134221e0-f150-4763-89e4-4bb876cfa91e-0
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:18.835
The compounder has performed
hand hygiene and garbing for the

134221e0-f150-4763-89e4-4bb876cfa91e-1
00:00:18.835 --> 00:00:20.880
hazardous drug clean room.

04091f9b-be0d-46dd-b616-89b4cb0f11a1-0
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.037
All the supplies used in this
hazardous drug CSP have been

04091f9b-be0d-46dd-b616-89b4cb0f11a1-1
00:00:26.037 --> 00:00:30.742
wiped off with 70% IPA using a
sterile lint free wiper before

04091f9b-be0d-46dd-b616-89b4cb0f11a1-2
00:00:30.742 --> 00:00:34.840
introducing items into the
biological safety cabinet.

7cf8ad18-77bf-47f3-9bfe-b0f4a0379b56-0
00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:40.744
The compounder is wiping the
chemo gloves off with a pre

7cf8ad18-77bf-47f3-9bfe-b0f4a0379b56-1
00:00:40.744 --> 00:00:45.779
saturated 70% IPA wiper and then
placing that wiper into the

7cf8ad18-77bf-47f3-9bfe-b0f4a0379b56-2
00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.760
yellow sharps container.

6ff21944-61a3-40df-95df-7bb17502ef6d-0
00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:55.054
Open the outer packaging of the
IV bag and you'll discard that

6ff21944-61a3-40df-95df-7bb17502ef6d-1
00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:59.240
packaging in the yellow Chemo
Sharps container.

71a98f3d-2f92-401f-8520-e60d967eb69f-0
00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:10.829
Next, we'll open the packaging
of the tubing and you'll discard

71a98f3d-2f92-401f-8520-e60d967eb69f-1
00:01:10.829 --> 00:01:18.890
that outer wrapper and you'll
position the tubing in your hand

71a98f3d-2f92-401f-8520-e60d967eb69f-2
00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:25.160
so that you will have access to
this roll clamp.

951c8838-28c9-4cba-857d-27ac22e598ef-0
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:36.329
And then we're going to roll
that clamp closed and we're

951c8838-28c9-4cba-857d-27ac22e598ef-1
00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:40.660
going to place this tubing so
that we it's not going to

951c8838-28c9-4cba-857d-27ac22e598ef-2
00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.599
interfere with us going into the
bag.

665d0cfa-cb23-4556-93bc-d1085de1bb20-0
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.550
You're going to remove the pull
tag that covers the Ivy bag

665d0cfa-cb23-4556-93bc-d1085de1bb20-1
00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:52.921
tubing port and I like to tuck
the injection port so that you

665d0cfa-cb23-4556-93bc-d1085de1bb20-2
00:01:52.921 --> 00:01:55.600
have easy access to that tubing
port.

23042dfa-cd19-4126-966e-4c07c8459c20-0
00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:00.576
And then we're going to
carefully make sure that we get

23042dfa-cd19-4126-966e-4c07c8459c20-1
00:02:00.576 --> 00:02:04.720
all the way into a nice seal
inside of that bag port.

8d8d3fca-b35e-4e5a-89db-bde383d4daf5-0
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.680
You're going to pinch the drip
chamber once or twice.

5b637e81-0209-4db3-87f2-faf0aba4791e-0
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.200
This tubing has a vented cap.

b03c1558-0939-475a-98bf-fe3feace67ee-0
00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:21.584
So we are going to open the roll
clamp on that tubing very slowly

b03c1558-0939-475a-98bf-fe3feace67ee-1
00:02:21.584 --> 00:02:27.160
and we're going to watch that
fluid fill the four tubing.

25909619-4982-4555-bb4c-d37d89236bf8-0
00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:35.607
When it gets to the end of that
vented cap, we'll roll that

25909619-4982-4555-bb4c-d37d89236bf8-1
00:02:35.607 --> 00:02:40.942
clamp closed and then we'll
momentarily set that back on the

25909619-4982-4555-bb4c-d37d89236bf8-2
00:02:40.942 --> 00:02:42.080
work surface.

f3fa2c2c-50c0-46a1-90f3-a7dfbb7772f2-0
00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:47.793
We're going to open a red tip
cap and once you peel back the

f3fa2c2c-50c0-46a1-90f3-a7dfbb7772f2-1
00:02:47.793 --> 00:02:52.351
packaging, you want to be
careful to ensure that you don't

f3fa2c2c-50c0-46a1-90f3-a7dfbb7772f2-2
00:02:52.351 --> 00:02:57.296
touch contaminate the critical
site of this red tip, using your

f3fa2c2c-50c0-46a1-90f3-a7dfbb7772f2-3
00:02:57.296 --> 00:03:01.160
knuckle to help you because the
gloves are slick.

f236cf45-3ed5-45d1-b6ba-21fb51501c79-0
00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.040
And then we'll place that on the
work surface.

29ee6f3f-c1d5-4cd8-8759-602ba58f3fe1-0
00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:15.878
We're going to bring our chemo
vial onto the chemo mat and

29ee6f3f-c1d5-4cd8-8759-602ba58f3fe1-1
00:03:15.878 --> 00:03:23.296
we'll open a sterile IPA swab
for the cap of the chemo

29ee6f3f-c1d5-4cd8-8759-602ba58f3fe1-2
00:03:23.296 --> 00:03:25.320
dispensing pan.

26b2132a-5f23-4248-ba0d-aaa516067ef4-0
00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:30.760
Be aware of the vertical airflow
from the HEPA filter that is

26b2132a-5f23-4248-ba0d-aaa516067ef4-1
00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:35.720
going to come over the sterile
IPA pad and then place that on

26b2132a-5f23-4248-ba0d-aaa516067ef4-2
00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.080
the work surface.

c3901c3c-c431-44ce-a3b4-5908bece5e68-0
00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:44.043
We're going to open the cap of
our chemo vial and put it in our

c3901c3c-c431-44ce-a3b4-5908bece5e68-1
00:03:44.043 --> 00:03:46.000
chemo Sharps container.

f94df40e-8530-4344-aad6-64dda1e14230-0
00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:52.936
And then we're open another
sterile IPA swab and we'll clean

f94df40e-8530-4344-aad6-64dda1e14230-1
00:03:52.936 --> 00:03:59.080
the stopper of our vial and you
can kind of clean up as you go.

1d82b392-eb2b-4bab-a030-0f478693ae80-0
00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:02.840
We'll open our chemo dispensing
pin.

c1f4e2c0-62fe-4b25-9fd0-eb9aab95e1e0-0
00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.280
It's a closed system.

ceb102c6-13fb-49dc-85f8-96ff01efee47-0
00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:08.713
There's caps on both of those
ends and then we'll discard that

ceb102c6-13fb-49dc-85f8-96ff01efee47-1
00:04:08.713 --> 00:04:09.840
outer packaging.

b5fcc894-2666-4387-845a-91f4e7f14e4d-0
00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:14.546
And we want to hold on to that
chemo dispensing pin with our

b5fcc894-2666-4387-845a-91f4e7f14e4d-1
00:04:14.546 --> 00:04:18.602
forefinger and our thumb and
then we're going to put that

b5fcc894-2666-4387-845a-91f4e7f14e4d-2
00:04:18.602 --> 00:04:21.120
into the vial in a twisting
motion.

c40e16a0-d932-4e22-ac67-fe3501171976-0
00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.673
We'll hold on to the outer flap
and we'll take that cap off of

c40e16a0-d932-4e22-ac67-fe3501171976-1
00:04:25.673 --> 00:04:27.520
that chemo dispensing pin.

f53d7859-b884-4cc3-a03e-efaa843748f4-0
00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:33.011
Let's go ahead and push that
flat knob so that we can

f53d7859-b884-4cc3-a03e-efaa843748f4-1
00:04:33.011 --> 00:04:38.039
activate our syringe before we
bring it out of the packaging

f53d7859-b884-4cc3-a03e-efaa843748f4-2
00:04:38.039 --> 00:04:42.655
and then we'll discarded that
packaging into the Sharps

f53d7859-b884-4cc3-a03e-efaa843748f4-3
00:04:42.655 --> 00:04:43.480
container.

d668d3fe-b54d-4d07-be74-ab704ac4ea9f-0
00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.986
We want to hold on to our vial,
hold on to the flaps and then

d668d3fe-b54d-4d07-be74-ab704ac4ea9f-1
00:04:47.986 --> 00:04:52.160
we're going to turn so that we
can see those graduation marks.

1fefd0c7-6a64-4b11-914b-cfc0910f4e91-0
00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:58.600
I like to pull chemo at the 10
o'clock 4:00 position.

2f046a3a-d5a7-4474-8edf-cb81a6789fc5-0
00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:05.691
When you get some fluid, we will
remove that air pocket that came

2f046a3a-d5a7-4474-8edf-cb81a6789fc5-1
00:05:05.691 --> 00:05:11.056
from that chemo dispensing pin
at 12:00 and 6:00 and then we'll

2f046a3a-d5a7-4474-8edf-cb81a6789fc5-2
00:05:11.056 --> 00:05:16.504
get right back into that 10 and
four position and we'll pull out

2f046a3a-d5a7-4474-8edf-cb81a6789fc5-3
00:05:16.504 --> 00:05:20.360
the volume of the chemo for our
patient dose.

4d08b715-108c-4241-9ae5-f9a4c372fdbc-0
00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:28.578
Notice that the airflow is going
vertically over our critical

4d08b715-108c-4241-9ae5-f9a4c372fdbc-1
00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:31.840
sites as we pull that plunger
out.

6d6d3a9b-f881-47ca-a058-cd6ce81fe6ac-0
00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.640
We now have a critical site of
that inner plunger.

f40193d0-1118-4a3b-9785-07f92011273c-0
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:46.165
Once we get to the volume that
we need by the barrel, we will

f40193d0-1118-4a3b-9785-07f92011273c-1
00:05:46.165 --> 00:05:48.800
go to 8:00 and 2:00.

d52d133a-6800-40cd-b4db-239b77a5bc99-0
00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:54.317
We'll hold on to the flaps of
our chemo vial and then we will

d52d133a-6800-40cd-b4db-239b77a5bc99-1
00:05:54.317 --> 00:05:59.273
come off carefully off that
chemo dispensing pin go nice and

d52d133a-6800-40cd-b4db-239b77a5bc99-2
00:05:59.273 --> 00:05:59.680
slow.

a779083f-2f80-48b6-87e6-a79dfc9030a5-0
00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:07.611
Sometimes there will be a bead
of chemo and then we'll set that

a779083f-2f80-48b6-87e6-a79dfc9030a5-1
00:06:07.611 --> 00:06:11.160
vial back on the work service.

cca88ab5-38d3-4d17-a1f8-55a9defd7a90-0
00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.816
We're going to open our syringe,
the outer packaging and

cca88ab5-38d3-4d17-a1f8-55a9defd7a90-1
00:06:15.816 --> 00:06:18.600
carefully put that on to our
syringe.

dfbcbb52-a68d-49c7-9cc4-6f15f47f64ed-0
00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:25.260
And then we're going to pick up
that vial and we're going to

dfbcbb52-a68d-49c7-9cc4-6f15f47f64ed-1
00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.600
place that cap back on our vial.

e8cbbc5b-f021-4f51-b0f8-cd6a8bc4219a-0
00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:33.667
We'll get the check from the
pharmacist and then that vial

e8cbbc5b-f021-4f51-b0f8-cd6a8bc4219a-1
00:06:33.667 --> 00:06:37.320
can go into our chemo Sharps
container.

fc7a6a97-3e01-4b04-b20a-671303aa4979-0
00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:44.680
We're going to bring our bag in
preparation to inject our chemo.

5b1bbe80-df71-4441-918e-ee4028d7cc00-0
00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:50.517
We'll get a sterile IPA swab and
put that on the work surface,

5b1bbe80-df71-4441-918e-ee4028d7cc00-1
00:06:50.517 --> 00:06:54.400
and then we'll get a second
sterile IPA swab.

cd4664e1-4848-48f4-b4ee-b13f66d595a0-0
00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.997
Notice the airflow from the HEPA
filter and we'll clean off the

cd4664e1-4848-48f4-b4ee-b13f66d595a0-1
00:06:58.997 --> 00:07:00.800
injection port of the bag.

7139d556-04cf-43e3-9508-1be71ac63e6c-0
00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:10.737
And then we're going to get into
a dark position and we're going

7139d556-04cf-43e3-9508-1be71ac63e6c-1
00:07:10.737 --> 00:07:13.400
to go in at 8:00 and 2:00.

7fbdcecd-ee25-49bd-b57a-11de15837c9b-0
00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:17.785
We're going to position our
fingers on the flaps of the

7fbdcecd-ee25-49bd-b57a-11de15837c9b-1
00:07:17.785 --> 00:07:18.920
syringe to help us.

95118a64-8f19-4426-a7be-47b8f06da718-0
00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:24.951
And with the thumb, we're going
to push on that flat knob and

95118a64-8f19-4426-a7be-47b8f06da718-1
00:07:24.951 --> 00:07:29.160
we're going to inject the chemo
into our bag.

224007e3-5b56-4949-8757-07570b66971d-0
00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:33.818
Notice that I don't need to put
the needle all the way into the

224007e3-5b56-4949-8757-07570b66971d-1
00:07:33.818 --> 00:07:34.080
bag.

01780784-3010-4b82-96aa-4b8098dc0493-0
00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:39.120
We don't want to poke any of the
outer part of that bag.

4211db77-c0be-4004-ac60-4b61765440db-0
00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.096
We're going to come out by the
barrel slightly and then with

4211db77-c0be-4004-ac60-4b61765440db-1
00:07:56.096 --> 00:07:59.996
the thumb we're going to pull
back on that plunger to get what

4211db77-c0be-4004-ac60-4b61765440db-2
00:07:59.996 --> 00:08:03.710
is in the hub and the lumen so
that we don't have a bead of

4211db77-c0be-4004-ac60-4b61765440db-3
00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.320
chemo on this tubing port.

f2d08782-0c90-4658-91ad-c0e1ce8fa94c-0
00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:12.091
Once you come out, you can
discard that syringe in your

f2d08782-0c90-4658-91ad-c0e1ce8fa94c-1
00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:13.880
Sharps container.

2cc9d2a6-5cd6-4c54-906f-9f80ff5a6244-0
00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:22.784
We're going to open a sterile
IPA pad and we're going to clean

2cc9d2a6-5cd6-4c54-906f-9f80ff5a6244-1
00:08:22.784 --> 00:08:29.902
off the port of our and then
we're going to get a pre

2cc9d2a6-5cd6-4c54-906f-9f80ff5a6244-2
00:08:29.902 --> 00:08:34.120
saturated sterile 70% IPA wiper.

11e02e47-7b59-45f4-b4ee-2440f808b577-0
00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:42.892
We make sure that we have an
opening to our empty bag so that

11e02e47-7b59-45f4-b4ee-2440f808b577-1
00:08:42.892 --> 00:08:47.904
once we wipe off our bag and our
tubing, we can get into that

11e02e47-7b59-45f4-b4ee-2440f808b577-2
00:08:47.904 --> 00:08:49.360
empty plastic bag.

26e4a74c-57a0-4591-986f-bd9523ab1ff6-0
00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:54.723
We'll wipe off the entire bag
and the tubing and then we'll

26e4a74c-57a0-4591-986f-bd9523ab1ff6-1
00:08:54.723 --> 00:08:58.760
discard that wiper in our chemo
sharps container.

a9ccdb9e-71ac-42ad-9b2f-38560a154c6f-0
00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:06.145
And then we'll place the chemo
bag inside our our plastic bag

a9ccdb9e-71ac-42ad-9b2f-38560a154c6f-1
00:09:06.145 --> 00:09:12.518
and we'll close it and then
we'll get another pre saturated

a9ccdb9e-71ac-42ad-9b2f-38560a154c6f-2
00:09:12.518 --> 00:09:19.528
70% IPA wiper and we'll wipe off
that outer bag and we'll hand it

a9ccdb9e-71ac-42ad-9b2f-38560a154c6f-3
00:09:19.528 --> 00:09:21.440
to our pharmacist.

3c904874-fe92-40e2-b7ab-2fb9b6d78319-0
00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:35.320
The compounder has just finished
making the chemotherapy CSP and

3c904874-fe92-40e2-b7ab-2fb9b6d78319-1
00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.800
now disposing of the chemo mat.

e2e1f386-b8ae-4c98-a75b-1af44df8530b-0
00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:45.247
Fold it up and put it in the
chemo sharps container and then

e2e1f386-b8ae-4c98-a75b-1af44df8530b-1
00:09:45.247 --> 00:09:51.475
we'll clean off the DCA work
surface with a pre saturated 70%

e2e1f386-b8ae-4c98-a75b-1af44df8530b-2
00:09:51.475 --> 00:09:52.480
IPA wiper.

e10e2a06-9794-4d97-b176-fc74f76735a5-0
00:09:57.720 --> 00:10:01.560
And then we'll dispose of that
wiper in the sharps container.

379c1637-dc48-429c-ac69-df46baa95659-0
00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:06.320
And then we'll take off these
outer gloves and dispose of them

379c1637-dc48-429c-ac69-df46baa95659-1
00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:09.720
inside of the hood in this
sharps container.